{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05862","headline":"送从弟蕃游淮南 · 王维","name":"送从弟蕃游淮南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"读书复骑射，带劒游淮阴。\n淮阴少年辈，千里远相寻。\n高义难自隐，明时宁陆沈。\n岛夷九州外，泉馆三山深。\n席帆聊问罪，卉服尽成擒。\n归来见天子，拜爵赐黄金。\n忽思鲈鱼鱠，复有沧洲心。\n天寒蒹葭渚，日落云梦林。\n江城下枫叶，淮上闻秋砧。\n送归青门外，车马去駸駸。\n惆怅新丰树，空余天际禽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05862.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05862","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}